    "html": "<p>A car decelerates uniformly to rest. From an initial velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> to a velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2}\"></span>, it covers a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. How much further does it travel before coming to rest?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span></li></ol>"
